        "title": "Get Involved",
        "body": "<p>The OpenStack community formed a Bare Metal Special Interest Group (SIG) with the mission to make Ironic easy to operate and evangelize the use cases and utility of the bare metal service. To get involved in the SIG, subscribe to the <a href=\"http://lists.openstack.org/cgi-bin/mailman/listinfo/openstack-discuss\">OpenStack Discuss mailing list</a> or contact <a href=\"mailto:ecosystem@openstack.org\">ecosystem@openstack.org</a></p>"
